# Layout

Single crate `gprx`. Not a Cargo workspace. Do not create empty files ahead of the Issue that needs them.

```
src/lib.rs          # small public re-exports
src/error.rs        # P1A-1
src/workspace.rs    # P1A-2。`Workspace`（fit）と `QueryWorkspace`（predict_into）。同じ struct に詰め込まない
src/likelihood.rs   # P1A-3
src/kernel/         # all kernel leaves; never at src/*.rs
src/transform/      # target.rs, input.rs, pipeline.rs, columnwise.rs。葉に分けるかは P2B-20（P2B-10 のあと、または P2B-7 / P2B-8 で伸びたあと判断）。空ファイルは先に置かない
src/gpr/            # `mod.rs` 再エクスポート。`Gpr` と `FittedGpr` は同じモジュール（`model.rs`）。公開の小さい型は `types.rs`、Gram / Cholesky / MLL は `factor.rs`、単体テストは `tests.rs`
src/objective.rs    # Phase 1b
src/optimizer/      # P2B-1 / P2B-2 / P2B-15。`mod.rs` トレイト、`logit.rs`、ソルバは `lbfgs.rs` / `ncg.rs` / `neldermead.rs` / `fsa.rs`
src/rng.rs          # P2B-15。クレート私有の `SmallRng`（`sample` / リスタート / FSA）
src/persist/        # P2B-14。`config.json` + `model.safetensors`。`LoadedGpr` / `PersistRegistry`
tests/              # analytic.rs, goldens.rs, alloc.rs, recovery.rs, fit_goldens.rs, nelder_mead_goldens.rs; M0: cholesky_smoke.rs
benches/            # criterion; from P1A-18 (after first `Gpr` path)
compare/            # uv + sklearn + goldens/*.json。P2B-16 は compare/perf/（gprx / sklearn / libgp / friedrich。手動、CI なし）
examples/           # Phase 1b; P2-9 updates to `Gpr` + `FittedGpr`
.dev/               # design, roadmap, bench-log.md
```

Add later, not now: `src/online.rs` (Phase 3), `src/sparse.rs` (Phase 4).

M0 creates root crate files and `src/lib.rs` only. `src/kernel/` starts at P1A-5.

Public at Phase 1b / 2: `Gpr`, `Prediction`, `VarianceKind`, `PredictOptions`, `DistanceCachePolicy`, `kernel`, `GaussianLikelihood`, `transform`, `GprError`. P2-8 adds `FittedGpr`; `Gpr` becomes trainer-only (`fit(self)`). P2B: `Gpr<O: Optimizer = Lbfgs>` and `Gpr<Fixed>` (no `optimize: bool`, no ignored `solver`). Public `Optimizer` / `Objective` / `Differentiable` / `TwiceDifferentiable` / `IncrementalObjective`, `Interval` / `BoundedParam`, `FullRecompute` / `IncrementalRecompute` / `UsesChangeIndices` / `AcceptsRecompute`, `KernelTerm` / `KernelSpec::Custom`, `JitterPolicy`, `PredictiveCovariance`, `UnfittedTarget` / `UnfittedTransform` / `FittedStandardizeTarget` / `FittedMinMaxTarget` / `FittedStandardizeInput` / `FittedMinMaxInput`, `Pipeline` / `TargetPipeline` / `FittedPipeline` / `FittedTargetPipeline`, `ColumnwiseInput` / `FittedColumnwiseInput`, `NoDistanceCache` (`Gpr::from_points` for Linear / Constant / White). P2B-14: `FittedGpr::save` / `save_with_factor`, `LoadedGpr` / `LoadedDistance` / `PersistRegistry` / `FORMAT_VERSION`. P2B-15: `FastSimulatedAnnealing` / `BoundaryPolicy`. P2B-19 / P2B-21 / P2B-23: `CachedDistances` (default) / `UncachedDistances` / `RetainCholesky` / `ReuseCholesky` / `CholeskyBuffer` / `DistanceCachePolicy` stay crate-root. Public switch is `Gpr::with_prefer_memory` / `with_prefer_speed` (memory = `UncachedDistances` + `ReuseCholesky`, speed = default). `with_distance_cache_policy` / `with_cholesky_buffer` are `pub(crate)`. `from_points` has the same prefer methods (`C` stays `NoDistanceCache`). `FittedGpr` has no `with_prefer_*`. Keep `Workspace`, `QueryWorkspace`, and faer types crate-private. Combinations that would be ignored or rejected at runtime must not be representable (`.cursor/rules/types.mdc`).

Unit tests: `#[cfg(test)]` in the module. Integration tests: `tests/`. Golden files only under `compare/goldens/`.
